{"n":2,"nm":"Season 2","o":"Based on the book, True Believer, Season Two finds James Reece searching for a new purpose after finishing his list. But when the CIA corners him, Reece must clear his name by stopping a resurgent terrorist group that has turned an ally to their cause. In this globe-trotting espionage thriller, Reece will uncover a conspiracy that reaches from Moscow to Langley, even to his own family's history.","v":[{"k":"sGmhziz9MoE","n":"Season 2 Official Trailer"},{"k":"vnz0dFvqJ5M","n":"Season 2 Official Teaser"}],"eps":[{"n":1,"t":"Episode 1","d":"2026-10-21","rt":0,"r":0,"o":"","s":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/la4SHCxng0nXytEEbEm51oy1jqT.jpg"},{"n":2,"t":"Episode 2","d":"2026-10-21","rt":0,"r":0,"o":"","s":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oEQuS1MFItTnZTe43j5Dwu3Qn9O.jpg"},{"n":3,"t":"Episode 3","d":"2026-10-21","rt":0,"r":0,"o":"","s":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/snS0C35t16tU6Umt9dQBPlYDBrK.jpg"},{"n":4,"t":"Episode 4","d":"2026-10-21","rt":0,"r":0,"o":"","s":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t7LLhV6Isx75MZK8Bj5LQY0ZFUv.jpg"},{"n":5,"t":"Episode 5","d":"2026-10-21","rt":0,"r":0,"o":"","s":""},{"n":6,"t":"Episode 6","d":"2026-10-21","rt":0,"r":0,"o":"","s":""},{"n":7,"t":"Episode 7","d":"2026-10-21","rt":0,"r":0,"o":"","s":""},{"n":8,"t":"Episode 8","d":"2026-10-21","rt":0,"r":0,"o":"","s":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/btyMlEz54wrKK5piUomM0w4JXzA.jpg"}]}